  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/669/669-17-d.htm",
  "statuteText": "669:17-d Discontinuing Office of Elected Treasurer. –\n\nWhen a town votes to discontinue an elected treasurer office, the person holding the elected office of treasurer at the time of the vote to discontinue it shall continue to hold office until the annual town election first following the discontinuance of the office, at which time the elected office of treasurer shall terminate irrespective of the length of that officer's term."
